     A*     MEDICARE 2ND PAY DATA EXTRACT LOG FILE                   *
     A*                                                              *
     A*     DESC:  THIS FILE CONTAINS LOG RECORDS OF EACH MEDICARE   *
     A*            2ND PAY DATA EXTRACT PROCESSED.  EACH CLAIM THAT  *
     A*            IS EXTRACTED WILL CREATE A LOG RECORD EACH TIME   *
     A*            IT SUBMITS DATA IN THE EXPORT.                    *
     A*                                                              *
     A*    06/12/09  C:65   PROJECT: WC1819                          *
     A*                                                              *
     A*     NOTE: SUBMITTED DATA ELEMENTS HAVE STANDARD FIELD NAME   *
     A*           STARTING WITH D1, BUT THE APPLIED DATA ELEMENTS    *
     A*           BEGIN WITH D2 INSTEAD.                             *
     A*                                                              *
     A** ========================================================= **
     A* REVISIONS:                                                   *
     A*                                                              *
     A* 03/06/25 C:333 Project: WC2998                               *
     A*                Changes to CMS Settlement Reporting.          *
     A*
     A* 10/11/21 C:298 Project: WC2822
     A*                CMS Response File Format Change
     A*
     A* 04/27/15 C:53  Project: WC2261
     A*                Update file for ICD-10 codes.
     A*
     A* 04/12/11 C: 58 Project: WC1975                               *
     A*                -Add 1 field D1CLEX adjuster staff code  3A
     A*                                                              *
     A* 02/02/11 C:235 Project: 114WXO                               *
     A*                -Added 1 fields D1RSPD(Response Descp.)len 40 *
     A*                                                              *
     A* 05/18/10 C:198 Project: WC1879                               *
     A*                -Added 2 fields DCN1 and DCN2 each of len 30  *
     A*                -Added a Re-submit flag.                      *
     A*                                                              *
