     A*  MEDICARE 2ND PAY DATA EXTRACT LOG FILE
     A*
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PD101                     TEXT('MEDICARE EXTRACT LOG FILE')
     A            D1CO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('CO#')
     A            D1FND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP')
